@startuml archive-handover-example

' Reader-facing time sequence for the German archive handover guide: one invoice
' dispatch from commit to the archive's acknowledgement, with clock times.
' The status feedback sits below a separator so the delivery part stays compact.
' All names and times are fictitious.

skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #1A73E8
  FontColor #ffffff
  BorderColor #2D66B0
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor #ffffff
  BorderColor #2D66B0
}
skinparam sequence {
  LifeLineBorderColor #3C4043
  LifeLineBorderThickness 1.5
  ArrowColor #202124
  ArrowThickness 1.5
}

actor "Frau Brandner\n(Büro)" as User
participant "Little Trotter\nX-Invoice" as App
participant "Postausgangsserver (SMTP)\n(Anbieter Brandner)" as Smtp #188038
participant "Bäckerei Steinmetz\n(Empfänger)" as Customer #5F6368
participant "E-Mail-Archiv\n(Anbieter Brandner)" as Archive #188038

User -> App : 09:12 Finale E-Rechnung
App --> App : PDF mit XML und Archivpaket der Rechnung erzeugt,\nZeitpunkt protokolliert
User -> App : 09:14 E-Mail senden

== Übertragung 1: Kundenversand (SMTP) ==
App -> Smtp : 09:14 SMTP-Übertragung (STARTTLS)
Smtp --> App : 09:14:08 SMTP-Quittung (250 OK)
Smtp -> Customer : 09:14:09 Zustellung

== Übertragung 2: Archivübergabe (SMTP, Option B) ==
App -> Smtp : 09:14:10 Separate SMTP-Übertragung (STARTTLS)\nRCPT TO: archiv@...
Smtp --> App : 09:14:15 SMTP-Quittung (250 OK)
Smtp -[#188038]> Archive : 09:14:16 Einlieferung in Archivpostfach

== Status & Archivpaket ==
App --> User : 09:14:15 Status „Übergeben“ (aus SMTP-Quittung)
App --> App : 09:16 Archivpaket der E-Mail bereit

@enduml
